{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Furniture Fu",
    "steam_appid": 3645490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE FU</strong> (affectionately known as Fu Fu) is a roguelike, hoard fighting, furniture arranging, gum-chewing, butt-kicking, all-singing, all-dancing ... thing. You must fight ghouls, use their money to buy furniture, which powers you up to fight more ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture where they want to be placed to power them up. Where you place furniture is almost as important as what you place! Taking care with placement gives a huge edge over the course of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game divides into placement and combat. Combat rewards reflexes, dodging and timing skills, where the placement rewards strategy and organisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance your two inner wolves</strong>: the urge to build beautiful, cosy homes, and the urge to kill everything you see. Build carefully arranged maisonettes, or embrace chaos and play optimally. The world is your oyster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match from a huge range of furniture, from the pretentious chaise longue to the globe to the sofa to the printer to the humble cardboard box. Each placeable has a classic roguelike-style item effect and a unique set of furniture likes and dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200 placeable items</strong> including big floor furniture, knickknacks for the tabletops and stuff to hang on walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil looking foes</strong> to provide noble adversaries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder enemies over time</strong> that's how games work!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three playable character</strong> to cover all your roleplay needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges and stakes</strong> like that other game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/555ffe13e764e8f602ae5dd6bee08997.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE FU</strong> (affectionately known as Fu Fu) is a roguelike, hoard fighting, furniture arranging, gum-chewing, butt-kicking, all-singing, all-dancing ... thing. You must fight ghouls, use their money to buy furniture, which powers you up to fight more ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture where they want to be placed to power them up. Where you place furniture is almost as important as what you place! Taking care with placement gives a huge edge over the course of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game divides into placement and combat. Combat rewards reflexes, dodging and timing skills, where the placement rewards strategy and organisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/2ed65ef2f5c3b092456ba7fce8d5e74e.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance your two inner wolves</strong>: the urge to build beautiful, cosy homes, and the urge to kill everything you see. Build carefully arranged maisonettes, or embrace chaos and play optimally. The world is your oyster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match from a huge range of furniture, from the pretentious chaise longue to the globe to the sofa to the printer to the humble cardboard box. Each placeable has a classic roguelike-style item effect and a unique set of furniture likes and dislikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.poster.avif?t=1750269294\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.webm?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645490/extras/6f9011d4806ca1469b6a6f33438350c3.mp4?t=1750269294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200 placeable items</strong> including big floor furniture, knickknacks for the tabletops and stuff to hang on walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil looking foes</strong> to provide noble adversaries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder enemies over time</strong> that's how games work!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three playable character</strong> to cover all your roleplay needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges and stakes</strong> like that other game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
